			"notes": "## This mod is now called Menu Pause instead of Inventory Pause!\nThis is to avoid confusion with [the original Fabric mod by umollu](https://github.com/umollu/inventory-pause)\n\nThis is a port of [Version 4.0: Proper slow motion and modded support for 1.20.4](https://github.com/macbrayne/inventory-pause-forge/releases/tag/v4.0.0) to 1.20.6 Fabric and NeoForge - yes, this mod is now also available for Fabric!\n\nA \"Force Unpause\" feature was added allowing you to unpause screens that are paused by default or using the config.\nA minor bug was also fixed - the indicator in the Mod Compat Options text fields now no longer overlaps the entered text."
